{"slug":"setup-setup","title":"Barkpark — Standalone Setup","blocks":[{"id":"b1","type":"ingress","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Barkpark is a Phoenix API backed by a PostgreSQL document substrate. This guide takes you from a clean clone to a running server on "},{"type":"text","value":"localhost:4000","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", with a seeded database you can verify. Every command below was run and returned exit 0 in test."}]},{"id":"b2","type":"callout","tone":"info","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Installing Barkpark to ","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":"use","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" it?","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" Start at QUICKSTART.md — "},{"type":"text","value":"curl | sh","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" + "},{"type":"text","value":"bp setup","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". This guide is for running the Phoenix API "},{"type":"text","value":"from a clone","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" (contributors, plugin authors)."}]},{"id":"b3","type":"callout","tone":"info","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Tested 2026-05-28 on Elixir 1.19.5 / Postgres 17.9 / macOS."}]},{"id":"b4","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Tested versions"},{"id":"b5","type":"table","head":[[{"type":"text","value":"Component"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Tested version"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Floor"}]],"rows":[[[{"type":"text","value":"Elixir"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1.19.5 (Erlang/OTP 28)"}],[{"type":"text","value":"~> 1.15","marks":["code"]}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"PostgreSQL"}],[{"type":"text","value":"17.9"}],[{"type":"text","value":"14+"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"libvips"}],[{"type":"text","value":"8.18.2"}],[{"type":"text","value":"— (required)"}]]]},{"id":"b6","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Prerequisites"},{"id":"b7","type":"table","head":[[{"type":"text","value":"Prerequisite"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Why"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Check"}]],"rows":[[[{"type":"text","value":"Homebrew Elixir/Erlang"}],[{"type":"text","value":"The toolchain ("},{"type":"text","value":"/opt/homebrew/bin","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":")"}],[{"type":"text","value":"which mix","marks":["code"]}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"PostgreSQL on "},{"type":"text","value":"localhost:5432","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"The document store"}],[{"type":"text","value":"brew services start postgresql@17","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" or Postgres.app"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"libvips"}],[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"text","value":"image","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" dep needs it or media probing fails"}],[{"type":"text","value":"brew install vips","marks":["code"]}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"postgres","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" role w/ password "},{"type":"text","value":"postgres","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"config/dev.exs","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" hardcodes this"}],[{"type":"text","value":"see below"}]]]},{"id":"b8","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"The Postgres role gotcha (verified, real)"},{"id":"b9","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"config/dev.exs","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" connects as the "},{"type":"text","value":"postgres","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" role with password "},{"type":"text","value":"postgres","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". A bare "},{"type":"text","value":"psql","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" on macOS uses your "},{"type":"text","value":"login","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" role, not "},{"type":"text","value":"postgres","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — so \"psql works\" does not mean barkpark will connect. Verify the role barkpark actually uses:"}]},{"id":"b10","type":"code","value":"PGPASSWORD=postgres psql -h localhost -U postgres -d postgres -tAc \"SELECT current_user;\"\n# → postgres"},{"id":"b11","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"If your Mac Postgres lacks that role, create it (with a "},{"type":"text","value":"postgres","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"-password login) or override the credentials in "},{"type":"text","value":"config/dev.exs","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"id":"b12","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Setup sequence"},{"id":"b13","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Each step exited 0 in test:"}]},{"id":"b14","type":"code","value":"git clone https://github.com/FRIKKern/barkpark.git && cd barkpark\nbrew install vips                  # if not already present\n# ensure Postgres is up (brew services start postgresql@17, or Postgres.app)\ncd api\nmix deps.get                       # → \"All dependencies have been fetched\"\nmix ecto.setup                     # create + migrate + seed (see below)\nmix phx.server                     # serves on :4000"},{"id":"b15","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"mix ecto.setup","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" is the "},{"type":"text","value":"mix.exs","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" alias:"}]},{"id":"b16","type":"code","value":"[\"ecto.create\", \"ecto.migrate\", \"run priv/repo/seeds.exs\"]"},{"id":"b17","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"So one command creates the database, runs every migration, and runs the seed script."}]},{"id":"b18","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"CRITICAL — do not use the make targets locally"},{"id":"b19","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"text","value":"make","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" targets are "},{"type":"text","value":"prod/Linux systemd wrappers","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" for the Hetzner box, not local dev commands."}]},{"id":"b20","type":"table","head":[[{"type":"text","value":"Target"}],[{"type":"text","value":"What it actually does"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Use locally instead"}]],"rows":[[[{"type":"text","value":"make seed","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"make migrate","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"make reset-db","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"Wrap "},{"type":"text","value":"start.sh","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", which hardcodes "},{"type":"text","value":"/root/.asdf","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" paths and "},{"type":"text","value":"MIX_ENV=prod","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"mix ecto.setup","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"mix ecto.migrate","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"mix ecto.reset","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (in "},{"type":"text","value":"api/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":")"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"make restart","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"make stop","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"make status","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"make logs","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"systemctl","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"journalctl","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" against the prod unit"}],[{"type":"text","value":"nothing — useless on macOS"}]]]},{"id":"b21","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Locally, always run bare "},{"type":"text","value":"mix","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" commands inside "},{"type":"text","value":"api/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"id":"b22","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"What seeding produces"},{"id":"b23","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"priv/repo/seeds.exs","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" dispatches on "},{"type":"text","value":"BARKPARK_SEED_PROFILE","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" ("},{"type":"text","value":"Barkpark.Seeds.run/0","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"). Raw "},{"type":"text","value":"mix","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" defaults to "},{"type":"text","value":"demo","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (everything below); "},{"type":"text","value":"bp setup","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" defaults to "},{"type":"text","value":"clean","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"id":"b24","type":"table","head":[[{"type":"text","value":""}],[{"type":"text","value":"demo","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (mix default)"}],[{"type":"text","value":"clean","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (bp setup default)"}]],"rows":[[[{"type":"text","value":"Schemas"}],[{"type":"text","value":"8 legacy types + plugin schemas"}],[{"type":"text","value":"plugin schemas only (paper, media)"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"Documents"}],[{"type":"text","value":"27 demo docs"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1 welcome paper ("},{"type":"text","value":"/papers/welcome","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":")"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"Token"}],[{"type":"text","value":"barkpark-dev-token","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"one admin token, printed ONCE (or minted from "},{"type":"text","value":"BARKPARK_SEED_ADMIN_TOKEN","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":")"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"Codelists"}],[{"type":"text","value":"EDItEUR + Thema"}],[{"type":"text","value":"none"}]]]},{"id":"b25","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Both profiles bootstrap tenancy and are idempotent on re-run. Demo counts, verified from a clean database:"}]},{"id":"b26","type":"table","head":[[{"type":"text","value":"Object"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Count"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Notes"}]],"rows":[[[{"type":"text","value":"schema_definitions","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"varies"}],[{"type":"text","value":"8 legacy content types (seeded directly) + plugin-contributed schemas registered on boot via "},{"type":"text","value":"Plugins.Bootstrap.register_all_schemas/0","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" ("},{"type":"text","value":"paper","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", the single "},{"type":"text","value":"task","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" schema, plus any other enabled plugins' schemas, e.g. media/onixedit/frt). Run "},{"type":"text","value":"SELECT count(*), count(distinct name) FROM schema_definitions;","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" against a freshly-seeded DB for the exact tally — it tracks the enabled plugin set."}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"documents","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"27"}],[{"type":"text","value":"post 9, page 5, project 4, author 3, category 3, colors/navigation/siteSettings 1 each"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"Workspaces"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Default Workspace"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"Projects"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Default Project (slug "},{"type":"text","value":"default","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":")"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"Datasets"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2"}],[{"type":"text","value":"production","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"paperflow","marks":["code"]}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"API tokens"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1"}],[{"type":"text","value":"barkpark-dev-token","marks":["code"]}]]]},{"id":"b27","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Details worth knowing:"}]},{"id":"b28","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"paper","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" registered 3×","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" — one NULL-scoped plus two dataset-scoped. This is the known media/tenancy pattern, "},{"type":"text","value":"not a bug","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Zero task documents","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" — seeds populate only legacy content. The single "},{"type":"text","value":"task","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" schema exists; no rows are seeded into it."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Tenancy is bootstrapped at MIGRATE time","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" (migration "},{"type":"text","value":"20260527110200_backfill_default_tenancy","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"), not lazily. The Default Workspace/Project/datasets exist after "},{"type":"text","value":"mix ecto.migrate","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", before any write."}],[{"type":"text","value":"barkpark-dev-token","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" has label "},{"type":"text","value":"dev-studio","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" and perms read/write/admin. It is stored "},{"type":"text","value":"sha256-hashed","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" — the plaintext above is what you send on the wire."}]]},{"id":"b29","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Verify it's running"},{"id":"b30","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"There is "},{"type":"text","value":"no /health endpoint","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":". The real liveness probe is the schemas list:"}]},{"id":"b31","type":"code","value":"curl -s localhost:4000/api/schemas | head -c 200\n# → [{\"name\":\"author\",...}]"},{"id":"b32","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"The Studio UI is at "},{"type":"text","value":"http://localhost:4000/studio","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (root "},{"type":"text","value":"/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" redirects there). Writes require auth:"}]},{"id":"b33","type":"code","value":"Authorization: Bearer barkpark-dev-token"},{"id":"b34","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Keep-alive on macOS"},{"id":"b35","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"There is "},{"type":"text","value":"no canonical service mechanism","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" for local dev — the "},{"type":"text","value":"make","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" targets are prod-only. To survive logout/reboot, use a LaunchAgent. Foreground options ("},{"type":"text","value":"make api","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", tmux "},{"type":"text","value":"make dev","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"run.sh","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":") do "},{"type":"text","value":"not","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" survive a session end."}]},{"id":"b36","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Create "},{"type":"text","value":"~/Library/LaunchAgents/dev.pelle.barkpark.plist","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" running "},{"type":"text","value":"mix phx.server","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" with:"}]},{"id":"b37","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"WorkingDirectory","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" = the "},{"type":"text","value":"api/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" directory"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Environment: "},{"type":"text","value":"PORT=4000","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"MIX_ENV=dev","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"RunAtLoad","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" = true, "},{"type":"text","value":"KeepAlive","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" = true"}],[{"type":"text","value":"StandardOutPath","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"text","value":"~/.paperflow/barkpark-server.out.log","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"StandardErrorPath","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"text","value":"~/.paperflow/barkpark-server.err.log","marks":["code"]}]]},{"id":"b38","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"KeepAlive=true","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" means launchd respawns the server if it dies. This is the only approach that survives logout/reboot."}]},{"id":"b39","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Gotchas"},{"id":"b40","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"libvips required.","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" The "},{"type":"text","value":"image","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" dependency needs it; without it media probing fails. "},{"type":"text","value":"brew install vips","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}],[{"type":"text","value":"NULL dataset_id docs are invisible to scoped reads.","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" Documents written with no tenancy scope (e.g. one of the three "},{"type":"text","value":"paper","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" registrations) drop out of strict dataset-scoped reads. Stamp the Default dataset on docs you want visible."}],[{"type":"text","value":"The drafts. prefix model.","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" Create writes to "},{"type":"text","value":"drafts.{id}","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"; publish copies it to "},{"type":"text","value":"{id}","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". A freshly created doc lives under the "},{"type":"text","value":"drafts.","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" prefix until published."}],[{"type":"text","value":"web/ is a separate Next.js demo","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":", not part of the API setup. It's a self-contained Vercel app ("},{"type":"text","value":"pnpm install && pnpm dev","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" inside "},{"type":"text","value":"web/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":") that reads the Phoenix API read-only — skip it for backend setup."}],[{"type":"text","value":":4000 port conflicts.","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" If the server won't bind, something else owns the port."}]]},{"id":"b41","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Troubleshooting"},{"id":"b42","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"Server won't connect to Postgres / ecto.setup fails on auth.","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" You don't have the "},{"type":"text","value":"postgres","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" role with password "},{"type":"text","value":"postgres","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". Run the verify command in Prerequisites; create the role or override "},{"type":"text","value":"config/dev.exs","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}],[{"type":"text","value":"localhost:4000 not responding.","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" Confirm the server is up with "},{"type":"text","value":"curl -s localhost:4000/api/schemas","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". There is no "},{"type":"text","value":"/health","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" endpoint — the schemas list is the probe. Check for a port conflict on "},{"type":"text","value":":4000","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}],[{"type":"text","value":"mix deps.get","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" or media operations fail mentioning "},{"type":"text","value":"vips","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"text","value":"image","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":".","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" libvips isn't installed: "},{"type":"text","value":"brew install vips","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", then "},{"type":"text","value":"mix deps.get","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" again."}]]}],"related":["setup-quickstart"]}
